    "changes_summary": "From packages/idempotency. constants.ts, deepSort.ts and errors.ts are real (errors.ts without the two error classes nothing here uses). persistence/BasePersistenceLayer.ts: the config-mismatch warning (#warnIfConfigMismatch and its fields) removed. persistence/IdempotencyRecord.ts: the DynamoDB type import used only by a doc link removed. IdempotencyConfig.ts: default custom JMESPath functions dropped. IdempotencyHandler.ts: the Middy middleware hooks and setFunctionPayloadToBeHashed removed, and the field doc comments (they repeat the option docs). types.ts is new: the types these files use, gathered from types/BasePersistenceLayer.ts, types/IdempotencyRecord.ts and types/IdempotencyOptions.ts, without doc comments. stubs.ts is new: stand-ins for the commons and jmespath packages and the Lambda types, plus a comment describing the conditional write the real stores do. Imports rewritten to point at types.ts and stubs.ts.",
