  "review": {
    "status": "pending",
    "notes": "Built by Claude 2026-10-27 from the pool entry for powertools-lambda-typescript (concept from the Amazon posting's top weights). For the reviewer: (1) 1,362 lines over 9 files, well over the 500-650 target. Cut options: drop IdempotencyHandler.ts to handle(), getFunctionResult() and #saveInProgressOrReturnExistingResult (about -150), or fold IdempotencyConfig.ts into stubs.ts (about -70). (2) The real code has a latent bug of its own: determineResultFromIdempotencyRecord compares inProgressExpiryTimestamp with new Date().getUTCMilliseconds() (0-999, not epoch ms), so that branch never runs. Left as is (it is the real code); the key gives credit for spotting it (R13). Possibly worth reporting upstream. (3) No concrete store (DynamoDB/Redis) is included; stubs.ts describes the conditional write instead. (4) Licence MIT-0 checked by Claude; needs a human check."
